## AMD AddrLib reference data

`patches/anyps5/0034-msaa-color-sample-layout.patch` and
`patches/anyps5/0036-msaa-depth-stencil-layout.patch` add color and depth/stencil
address-equation data derived from AMD AddrLib at PAL
`c5e800072a32f68b6ccc4422936d96167c6e0728`.
The generated headers retain AMD's copyright and permissive license notice.
The AnyPS5 integration remains GPL-2.0-only. The reference source/library used
by the local verifier is not vendored in this repository.

